      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my car from scratches during transport in Gandhinagar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp is equipped with non‑abrasive rubberized surfaces and adjustable guides that align perfectly with the vehicle’s wheelbase. Trained operators position soft‑foam chocks and use ratchet lashings to secure the car before it rolls onto the ramp. Throughout loading, the crew monitors pressure points and employs 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, ensuring zero contact damage and a scratch‑free transit.</p>
