        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for car transportation in Gandhinagar and how does the IBA‑approved GST bill help with reimbursement?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued identity proof, and a signed transport agreement. Shree Ashirwad issues an IBA‑approved GST invoice that lists the service code, GSTIN, and detailed cost components. This invoice is accepted by central and state government departments, PSUs, and corporate accounts for seamless reimbursement of relocation expenses.</p>
