        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it moves from Gandhinagar to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every enclosed carrier is fitted with a GPS unit that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant SMS and email alerts at key milestones—pickup, highway entry, border crossing, and delivery. The portal also shows estimated arrival time, route map, and any deviation alerts, giving you full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for car shipping, and what does the 100% declared‑value coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend it for peace of mind. Our IRDAI‑approved policy offers 100% declared‑value coverage, protecting against total loss, accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. The policy covers repair costs, replacement value, and any ancillary expenses such as towing, ensuring that your vehicle’s financial value is fully safeguarded.</p>
