        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the door‑to‑door service work for bike transport service in Gandhinagar alongside car shipping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our door‑to‑door solution treats bikes as a separate cargo class. After confirming the bike transport request, a dedicated two‑wheeler carrier equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings arrives at your address. The bike is loaded onto a padded platform, secured, and tracked with the same GPS system used for cars, guaranteeing safe, punctual delivery to the same destination.</p>
