        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for an 850 km journey from Gandhinagar to major Indian transport hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, an 850 km stretch via National Highway arterial corridors takes approximately 14‑16 hours of driving time. Accounting for mandatory driver rest periods, toll checks, and brief inspections, most shipments reach the destination within 18‑20 hours. We provide an estimated delivery window at booking and keep you updated if any unforeseen delay occurs.</p>
