        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on vehicle size or type for the enclosed container trucks used by Shree Ashirwad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The enclosed multi‑axle carriers can accommodate vehicles up to 2.2 meters in height and 2.5 meters in width, covering most hatchbacks, sedans, SUVs, and luxury models. Oversized trucks, heavy equipment, or vehicles with protruding accessories may require a custom solution or a dedicated flatbed. Our logistics team evaluates each request and suggests the optimal carrier to ensure safe transport.</p>
