{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my car from scratches during transport in Gandhinagar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The hydraulic ramp is equipped with non‑abrasive rubberized surfaces and adjustable guides that align perfectly with the vehicle’s wheelbase. Trained operators position soft‑foam chocks and use ratchet lashings to secure the car before it rolls onto the ramp. Throughout loading, the crew monitors pressure points and employs 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, ensuring zero contact damage and a scratch‑free transit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What documents are required for car transportation in Gandhinagar and how does the IBA‑approved GST bill help with reimbursement?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued identity proof, and a signed transport agreement. Shree Ashirwad issues an IBA‑approved GST invoice that lists the service code, GSTIN, and detailed cost components. This invoice is accepted by central and state government departments, PSUs, and corporate accounts for seamless reimbursement of relocation expenses."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I track my vehicle in real time while it moves from Gandhinagar to the destination hub?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every enclosed carrier is fitted with a GPS unit that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant SMS and email alerts at key milestones—pickup, highway entry, border crossing, and delivery. The portal also shows estimated arrival time, route map, and any deviation alerts, giving you full visibility throughout the journey."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is insurance mandatory for car shipping, and what does the 100% declared‑value coverage include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend it for peace of mind. Our IRDAI‑approved policy offers 100% declared‑value coverage, protecting against total loss, accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. The policy covers repair costs, replacement value, and any ancillary expenses such as towing, ensuring that your vehicle’s financial value is fully safeguarded."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the door‑to‑door service work for bike transport service in Gandhinagar alongside car shipping?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our door‑to‑door solution treats bikes as a separate cargo class. After confirming the bike transport request, a dedicated two‑wheeler carrier equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings arrives at your address. The bike is loaded onto a padded platform, secured, and tracked with the same GPS system used for cars, guaranteeing safe, punctual delivery to the same destination."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the typical transit times for an 850 km journey from Gandhinagar to major Indian transport hubs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Under normal traffic conditions, an 850 km stretch via National Highway arterial corridors takes approximately 14‑16 hours of driving time. Accounting for mandatory driver rest periods, toll checks, and brief inspections, most shipments reach the destination within 18‑20 hours. We provide an estimated delivery window at booking and keep you updated if any unforeseen delay occurs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there any restrictions on vehicle size or type for the enclosed container trucks used by Shree Ashirwad?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The enclosed multi‑axle carriers can accommodate vehicles up to 2.2 meters in height and 2.5 meters in width, covering most hatchbacks, sedans, SUVs, and luxury models. Oversized trucks, heavy equipment, or vehicles with protruding accessories may require a custom solution or a dedicated flatbed. Our logistics team evaluates each request and suggests the optimal carrier to ensure safe transport."}}]}
